        (10, "Distinguish gender equality, gender equity and women's empowerment, and explain why gender concerns must enter programme design.", "The three terms name a rights baseline, a constraint-removing instrument and an agency outcome, and programme design must map unequal starting conditions because equal rules applied to unequal time, mobility and assets reproduce the gap they claim to close.", [6, 7, 8, 9, 11]),
